{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"CLSA-2026-1791888827","published":"2026-10-13T10:54:01Z","modified":"2026-10-26T09:43:19.035295064Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-106571","CVE-2026-106577","CVE-2026-106579"],"summary":"Fix of 7 CVEs","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: integer overflow in the pixel cache staging buffer size\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106571.patch: use overflow-checked\n       multiplications for the staging buffer size in\n       SetPixelCacheNexusPixels() in magick/cache.c\n     - CVE-2026-106571\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: coder security policy bypass\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106579.patch: check the coder name against the\n       coder policy at all four decoder and encoder calls, including the\n       WriteImage() fallback, in magick/constitute.c\n     - CVE-2026-106579\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: PostScript code injection through image labels\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106577.patch: escape parentheses and backslashes\n       in, and trim, the labels written by the PS, PS2, PS3 and PDF coders in\n       coders/ps.c, coders/ps2.c, coders/ps3.c and coders/pdf.c\n     - CVE-2026-106577","affected":[{"package":{"name":"imagemagick","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:18.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/imagemagick?distro=ubuntu-18.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8:6.9.7.4+dfsg-16ubuntu6.15+tuxcare.els52"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu18.04els/CLSA-2026-1791888827.json"}},{"package":{"name":"imagemagick-6-common","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:18.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/imagemagick-6-common?distro=ubuntu-18.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8:6.9.7.4+dfsg-16ubuntu6.15+tuxcare.els52"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu18.04els/CLSA-2026-1791888827.json"}},{"package":{"name":"imagemagick-6-doc","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:18.04","purl":"pkg:deb/t